    <node id="&quot;THE GIRL ON THE TRAIN (2013 FILM)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MOVIE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Girl on the Train (2013 film) is an American independent thriller film directed and written by Quentin Tarantino, and produced by various producers. It stars Henry Ian Cusick, Nicki Aycox, Stephen Lang."</data>
